      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Starts on the first matching day on or after the selected date. Changes to the original item, including how it repeats, apply to all its linked items. Changing how a linked item repeats unlinks it and makes it a new original item. Completion is separate for each item.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 24,
          "startingLine": 471
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Repeat this item every day, every weekday, every week or on days you choose. Each occurrence stays on its own day and is completed separately.",
